main_02_07_14","type":"Choice","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_02_07_14","text":"I'm just peachy.","jump":"d_main_02_07_15","exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_02_07_15","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_02_07_15","text":"Hey, watch what you say when you're behind me! You're in my \"line of fire\", if you know what I mean.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_02_07_16","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_02_07_16","text":"I never thought we'd be sneaking in through a drain.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_02_07_17","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_02_07_17","text":"Most Commanders treat Nikkes as weapons, so they prefer using confrontational tactics.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_02_07_18","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_02_07_18","text":"Tactics, my ass. They're just too lazy to come up with any other kind of plan.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_02_07_19","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_02_07_19","text":"They all think they're God's gift to mankind. Meanwhile, they throw a tantrum when they get a speck of dirt on their uniform. It makes me sick.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_02_07_20","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_m